    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4596" root="ثل" body-key="v">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انثلّ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a thing) <i>poured forth,</i> or <i>became
poured forth.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْثَلُّوا</span> <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْثَالُوا</span> [app.
as meaning <i>They poured themselves forth</i>]. (K.)
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انثلّوا عَلَيْهِ</span> <i>They poured forth,</i> or <i>down,
upon him,</i> or <i>against him.</i> (Z, TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثلم</span>.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also 5.

